' =====================================================================
'  GENERAR_PLANOS  v2.18  -  Regla externa iLogic (Inventor 2026) - COIMSER
'  Genera el juego de planos de FABRICACION y HABILITADO de un ensamble
'  ya numerado con TEKLA_NUMERACION, en un solo .idw con una hoja por plano,
'  siguiendo la jerarquia:
'
'     PM1 (disposicion general)
'       EE-C1  conjunto      -> EE-C1-xs1, EE-C1-p1   (habilitados)
'       EE-C2  conjunto      -> EE-C2-xs1, EE-C2-b1   (habilitados)
'       EE-V1  conjunto      -> EE-V1-wp1
'
'  Una pieza identica en varios conjuntos se habilita UNA sola vez, detras
'  del conjunto que le dio la marca (propiedad CONJUNTO).
'  La perneria (compras / Content Center) no se dibuja como habilitado:
'  sale en la nota PERNERIA de cada conjunto.
'
'  Plantilla: "PLANTILLA COIMSER A3 - TEKLA.idw" (se busca en la carpeta
'  del ensamble y en las superiores, tambien en \plantillas).
'  Salida:    <carpeta ensamble>\PLANOS\<PLANTA>-<ENSAMBLE>-FAB.idw  + .pdf
'
'  v2 - MODO ACTUALIZACION (no crea otro plano):
'   - Si el .idw ya existe (o ejecutas la regla desde el propio .idw) lo ABRE y:
'       * hojas que ya existen  -> actualiza nota (cant., peso, escala) y globos;
'                                  NO toca vistas, cotas ni lo que agregaste a mano
'       * marcas nuevas         -> crea su hoja
'       * marcas que ya no estan-> renombra la hoja "OBSOLETO ..." y la manda al final
'                                  (no se borra nada)
'       * hojas tuyas (sin marca)-> se quedan detras de la hoja que seguian
'       * reordena todo: GA - conjunto - sus habilitados - conjunto - ...
'   - Cada hoja queda identificada con un atributo (COIMSER_PLANOS / CLAVE),
'     asi la reconoce aunque le cambies el nombre.
'
'  v2.1 - Nota de ubicacion (PERTENECE A / RUTA, de TEKLA_NUMERACION v2.2) y bloque de
'         NOTAS DE FABRICACION leido de NOTAS_FABRICACION.txt (secciones [GENERAL],
'         [CONJUNTO], [HABILITADO]); se edita el .txt y se vuelve a ejecutar la regla.
'
'  v2.18 - Antes de ACTUALIZAR un plano existente guarda copia del .idw en PLANOS\_SUPERADOS\<fecha>_ANTES.\n'  v2.17 - PLANO JERARQUICO (por defecto): cada ensamble lleva SU plano con su disposicion, los
'         habilitados de SUS piezas y una hoja por subconjunto directo ("DETALLE Y HABILITADOS EN PLANO
'         <sub>-FAB"). En la misma corrida se genera el plano de CADA conjunto y subconjunto (cualquier
'         nivel, con PREFIJO y MARCA) en su carpeta <conjunto>\PLANOS. La fase queda corta (general +
'         una hoja por conjunto + piezas sueltas). Las hojas que pasan a otro plano se quitan, con copia
'         previa del .idw / .pdf en PLANOS\_SUPERADOS\<fecha>. Argumentos: detalle=COMPLETO (plano unico
'         con todo, como antes), conjuntos=NO (solo el plano del ensamble abierto).
'  v2.15 - El conjunto pasa a ESTADO = PLANOS al generarle el plano (SubirEstado).
'  v2.14 - En el plano de un conjunto: CANT. DE CONJUNTOS EN LA FASE (x n -> TOTAL), nota "MARCA DE <conjunto>"
'         en las piezas compartidas con otro conjunto y nota VER PLANO <subconjunto> en los subconjuntos.
'  v2.13 - PAQUETE POR CONJUNTO: la fase (TIPO_ENSAMBLE=PLANTA) deja su plano general en <fase>\PLANOS; un
'         conjunto o subconjunto (con PREFIJO) deja sus planos de fabricacion y habilitado en SU carpeta
'         (<fase>\<conjunto>\PLANOS), junto a sus Piezas. Las piezas compartidas con otro conjunto
'         tambien se habilitan en cada conjunto que las usa (el taller tiene todo en un solo paquete).
'  v2.12 - Nombre del plano de un conjunto: PLCAY-CP1-CH-001-FAB (antes repetia la planta: CP1-PLCAY-CP1-CH-001-FAB).
'  v2.11 - Vistas proyectadas con reintento (fallaban en perfiles girados largos: "El parametro no es
'         correcto"). Si una hoja falla, se avisa y se siguen generando las demas.
'  v2.10 - Las hojas que ya existian con el modelo girado dibujado torcido se rehacen solas al
'          ejecutar GENERAR_PLANOS (no hace falta rehacer=SI).
'  v2.9 - VISTAS EN LOS EJES DEL MODELO: si el conjunto o la pieza vino girado (STEP, referencia
'         torcida) las vistas se orientan con la pieza mas grande (su cara mayor y su arista mas
'         larga), no con los ejes del ensamble. Si ya esta casi recto (< 0.5 grados) no cambia nada.
'         Argumento rehacer=SI para rehacer todas las hojas ya existentes con las vistas nuevas.
'  v2.8 - Rehace desarrollos "de canto" (ancho = espesor) con la cara A en la cara mayor.
'  v2.7 - ESTILO_PLANO y NOTAS_FABRICACION se toman de la carpeta de reglas (Git), aunque las
'         reglas esten en subcarpetas; las notas propias de una obra (en su carpeta) tienen prioridad.
'  v2.6 - CHAPA (Sheet Metal): el habilitado lleva tambien el DESARROLLO (chapa desplegada) a la
'         derecha, con cotas totales, notas de plegado y su medida. Si la pieza aun no tenia desarrollo
'         se crea. En hojas que ya existian se agrega en el espacio libre (si no entra, lo avisa;
'         argumento desarrollo=rehacer rehace esas hojas). Argumento desarrollo=NO para no ponerlo.
'  v2.5 - REFERENCIAS (NUEVA_REFERENCIA: skeletons, equipos existentes, estructura existente)
'         se OCULTAN en todas las vistas y no cuentan para la escala ni para los globos.
'  v2.4 - Si el modelo crecio y las vistas de una hoja existente ya no entran a su escala,
'         la hoja se rehace a la escala que corresponde (argumento no_reencuadrar para evitarlo).
'  v2.3 - Columnas de la lista de materiales ajustadas al texto. Al final aplica la regla
'         ESTILO_PLANO (letra, capas y colores COIMSER) a todo el plano, tambien a los antiguos.
'         Argumento estilo=NO para no aplicarla.
'  v2.2 - Siempre usa el ensamble PRINCIPAL abierto aunque estes editando un subensamble
'         (antes creaba un plano aparte para el subensamble). Inventor en espanol: OK.
'  Argumentos opcionales: silencioso, plantilla=<ruta>, pdf=NO, nuevo (regenera desde cero),
'                         solo_este (plano solo del subensamble que estas editando)
' =====================================================================

Sub Main()
    silencioso = RuleArguments.Exists("silencioso")
    TG = ThisApplication.TransientGeometry
    Dim dwg As DrawingDocument = Nothing
    Dim existia As Boolean = False
    Dim asm As AssemblyDocument = TryCast(ThisDoc.Document, AssemblyDocument)
    ' Si estas editando un subensamble en el sitio, la regla igual trabaja con el ensamble
    ' PRINCIPAL abierto (un solo plano por planta). Argumento solo_este = plano del subensamble.
    If asm IsNot Nothing AndAlso Not RuleArguments.Exists("solo_este") Then
        Dim act As AssemblyDocument = TryCast(ThisApplication.ActiveDocument, AssemblyDocument)
        ' v2.17: solo si asm es el subensamble que se EDITA EN EL SITIO dentro del abierto (antes bastaba con
        ' que otro ensamble estuviera activo y la regla corrida desde otra ventana hacia el plano equivocado)
        Dim editando As Boolean = False
        Try
            editando = (ThisApplication.ActiveEditDocument Is asm)
        Catch
        End Try
        If act IsNot Nothing AndAlso Not (act Is asm) AndAlso editando Then
            If UProp(act, "TIPO_ENSAMBLE").ToUpper() = "GENERAL" Then
                ' dentro del ensamble GENERAL de la obra: el plano es de la planta que se edita
                Dim pl As AssemblyDocument = PlantaDe(act, asm)
                If pl IsNot Nothing Then asm = pl
            Else
                resumen.AppendLine("Se estaba editando " & System.IO.Path.GetFileName(asm.FullFileName) & ": se usa el ensamble principal " & System.IO.Path.GetFileName(act.FullFileName))
                asm = act
            End If
        End If
    End If
    If asm IsNot Nothing AndAlso UProp(asm, "TIPO_ENSAMBLE").ToUpper() = "GENERAL" Then
        MessageBox.Show("Este es el ensamble GENERAL de la obra." & vbCrLf & "Abre el ensamble de la planta (ej. ANT-EE.iam) y ejecuta la regla ahi.", "GENERAR_PLANOS")
        Exit Sub
    End If
    If asm Is Nothing Then
        dwg = TryCast(ThisDoc.Document, DrawingDocument)
        If dwg IsNot Nothing Then
            asm = EnsambleDelPlano(dwg)
            existia = True
        End If
    End If
    If asm Is Nothing Then
        MessageBox.Show("Ejecuta la regla desde el ensamble general (.iam) o desde un plano generado por esta regla.", "GENERAR_PLANOS")
        Exit Sub
    End If
    ' ---------- v2.17 PLANO JERARQUICO: el plano de este ensamble y uno por cada conjunto / subconjunto ----------
    jerarquico = (Arg("detalle").ToUpper() <> "COMPLETO")
    Dim total As New System.Text.StringBuilder()
    total.AppendLine(GenerarUno(asm, dwg, existia, False))
    If jerarquico AndAlso Arg("conjuntos").ToUpper() <> "NO" Then
        Dim hijos As List(Of AssemblyDocument) = Descendientes(asm)
        If hijos.Count > 0 Then total.AppendLine("PLANOS DE CONJUNTOS / SUBCONJUNTOS (" & hijos.Count & "):")
        For Each h As AssemblyDocument In hijos
            Reiniciar()
            Dim r As String = GenerarUno(h, Nothing, False, True)
            total.AppendLine("  " & System.IO.Path.GetFileNameWithoutExtension(h.FullFileName) & ": " & r.Split(New String() {vbCrLf}, StringSplitOptions.None)(0))
        Next
    End If
    Aviso(total.ToString())
End Sub


Function GenerarUno(asm As AssemblyDocument, dwg As DrawingDocument, existia As Boolean, hijo As Boolean) As String
    Dim msgUno As String = ""
    Dim visible As Boolean = Not silencioso AndAlso Not hijo
    Dim carpeta As String = CarpetaSalida(asm)
    Dim nombre As String = System.IO.Path.GetFileNameWithoutExtension(asm.FullFileName)
    Try
        planta = UProp(asm, "PLANTA")
        proy = UProp(asm, "PROYECTO")
        If planta = "" Then planta = "XX"

        ' ---------- 1. leer la jerarquia ----------
        Recorrer(asm.ComponentDefinition.Occurrences)
        If conjOrden.Count = 0 AndAlso partDoc.Count = 0 Then
            msgUno = "Sin marcas (corre TEKLA_NUMERACION): " & nombre
            Return msgUno
        End If

        ' ---------- 2. plano existente o nuevo ----------
        System.IO.Directory.CreateDirectory(carpeta)
        Dim ruta As String = System.IO.Path.Combine(carpeta, NomBase(planta, nombre) & "-FAB.idw")
        If dwg IsNot Nothing Then ruta = dwg.FullFileName
        If dwg Is Nothing Then
            For Each od As Document In ThisApplication.Documents
                If String.Compare(od.FullFileName, ruta, True) = 0 Then
                    dwg = od
                    Exit For
                End If
            Next
            If RuleArguments.Exists("nuevo") Then
                If dwg IsNot Nothing Then dwg.Close(True)
                dwg = Nothing
                If System.IO.File.Exists(ruta) Then System.IO.File.Delete(ruta)
            ElseIf dwg Is Nothing AndAlso System.IO.File.Exists(ruta) Then
                dwg = ThisApplication.Documents.Open(ruta, visible)
            End If
            existia = dwg IsNot Nothing
        End If
        If Not existia Then
            Dim tpl As String = BuscarPlantilla(asm)
            If tpl = "" Then
                msgUno = "No encuentro la plantilla 'PLANTILLA COIMSER A3 - TEKLA.idw'."
                Return msgUno
            End If
            resumen.AppendLine("Plantilla: " & tpl)
            dwg = ThisApplication.Documents.Add(DocumentTypeEnum.kDrawingDocumentObject, tpl, visible)
        Else
            resumen.AppendLine("Actualizando: " & ruta)
            ' v2.18: copia del plano tal como estaba guardado ANTES de actualizarlo (no se pierde el trabajo a mano)
            Try
                If System.IO.File.Exists(dwg.FullFileName) Then
                    Dim supA As String = System.IO.Path.Combine(System.IO.Path.Combine(System.IO.Path.GetDirectoryName(dwg.FullFileName), "_SUPERADOS"), DateTime.Now.ToString("yyyyMMdd_HHmmss") & "_ANTES")
                    System.IO.Directory.CreateDirectory(supA)
                    System.IO.File.Copy(dwg.FullFileName, System.IO.Path.Combine(supA, System.IO.Path.GetFileName(dwg.FullFileName)), True)
                    resumen.AppendLine("Copia previa del plano: " & supA)
                End If
            Catch
            End Try
        End If
        SetTag(dwg, "ENSAMBLE", asm.FullFileName)

        ' ---------- 3. sincronizar hojas ----------
        Sincronizar(dwg, asm, existia)

        ' ---------- 3b. estilo COIMSER (regla ESTILO_PLANO) ----------
        If Arg("estilo").ToUpper() <> "NO" Then AplicarEstilo(dwg, asm)

        ' ---------- 4. propiedades y guardado ----------
        Dim pSum As PropertySet = dwg.PropertySets.Item("Inventor Summary Information")
        If CStr(pSum.Item("Title").Value) = "" Then pSum.Item("Title").Value = "FABRICACION " & planta & " " & nombre
        Dim pDT As PropertySet = dwg.PropertySets.Item("Design Tracking Properties")
        If Not existia Then pDT.Item("Part Number").Value = NomBase(planta, nombre) & "-FAB"
        If proy <> "" AndAlso CStr(pDT.Item("Project").Value) = "" Then pDT.Item("Project").Value = proy
        If existia Then
            dwg.Save()
        Else
            dwg.SaveAs(ruta, False)
        End If
        resumen.AppendLine("Guardado: " & ruta & "  (" & dwg.Sheets.Count & " hojas)")
        SubirEstado(asm, "PLANOS")
        Dim pdfOk As Boolean = True
        If Arg("pdf").ToUpper() <> "NO" Then pdfOk = ExportarPdf(dwg, System.IO.Path.ChangeExtension(ruta, ".pdf"))
        Dim nh As Integer = dwg.Sheets.Count
        If (silencioso OrElse hijo) AndAlso Not (dwg Is ThisDoc.Document) Then dwg.Close(True)
        Dim m As String = If(existia, "Plano ACTUALIZADO: ", "Plano CREADO: ") & nh & " hojas" & vbCrLf & ruta & vbCrLf
        If hNuevas.Count > 0 Then m = m & "Hojas nuevas: " & String.Join(", ", hNuevas) & vbCrLf
        If hActual.Count > 0 Then m = m & "Hojas actualizadas: " & hActual.Count & vbCrLf
        If hObsol.Count > 0 Then m = m & "OBSOLETAS (revisar / anular): " & String.Join(", ", hObsol) & vbCrLf
        If Not pdfOk Then m = m & "(no se pudo exportar el PDF)"
        If errores.Count > 0 Then m = m & vbCrLf & "ATENCION - hojas que NO se pudieron crear (ver GENERAR_PLANOS.log): " & String.Join(", ", errores) & vbCrLf & "Vuelve a ejecutar la regla para reintentarlas."
        If hTras.Count > 0 Then m = m & "Hojas que pasaron al plano de su conjunto: " & hTras.Count & " (copia del plano anterior en PLANOS\_SUPERADOS)" & vbCrLf
        msgUno = m
    Catch ex As Exception
        resumen.AppendLine("ERROR: " & ex.Message & vbCrLf & ex.StackTrace)
        msgUno = "ERROR en " & nombre & ": " & ex.Message
    Finally
        Try
            System.IO.Directory.CreateDirectory(carpeta)
            System.IO.File.WriteAllText(System.IO.Path.Combine(carpeta, "GENERAR_PLANOS.log"), resumen.ToString())
        Catch
        End Try
    End Try
    Return msgUno
End Function

Private planta As String = ""
Private proy As String = ""
Private silencioso As Boolean
Private TG As TransientGeometry
Private errores As New List(Of String)
Private resumen As New System.Text.StringBuilder
Private conjOrden As New List(Of String)
Private conjDoc As New Dictionary(Of String, Document)
Private cantConj As New Dictionary(Of String, Integer)
Private partDoc As New Dictionary(Of String, Document)
Private cantParte As New Dictionary(Of String, Integer)
Private partesDe As New Dictionary(Of String, List(Of String))
Private hNuevas As New List(Of String)
Private hActual As New List(Of String)
Private hObsol As New List(Of String)
Private Const ATR As String = "COIMSER_PLANOS"
Private notasFab As Dictionary(Of String, String) = Nothing
Private modoGA As Boolean = False
Private Const BORDE As String = "COIMSER-A3-ZONAS"
Private Const ROTULO As String = "COIMSER-A3-ROTULO"
Private Const XMAX As Double = 41.0
Private Const YMAX As Double = 28.7

' ===================== jerarquia =====================
Sub Recorrer(occs As Object)
    For Each occ As ComponentOccurrence In occs
        If occ.Suppressed Then Continue For
        Dim d As Document = Nothing
        Dim bs As BOMStructureEnum = BOMStructureEnum.kDefaultBOMStructure
        Try
            d = occ.Definition.Document
            bs = occ.BOMStructure
        Catch
            Continue For
        End Try
        If bs = BOMStructureEnum.kReferenceBOMStructure OrElse bs = BOMStructureEnum.kPurchasedBOMStructure Then Continue For
        If UProp(d, "EQUIPO").ToUpper() = "SI" Then Continue For
        If UProp(d, "REFERENCIA").ToUpper() = "SI" Then Continue For
        Dim mk As String = UProp(d, "MARCA")
        If d.DocumentType = DocumentTypeEnum.kAssemblyDocumentObject Then
            If mk <> "" AndAlso bs <> BOMStructureEnum.kPhantomBOMStructure Then
                Sumar(cantConj, mk)
                If Not conjDoc.ContainsKey(mk) Then
                    conjDoc(mk) = d
                    conjOrden.Add(mk)
                End If
            End If
            ' v2.17: un subconjunto con plano propio se dibuja como hoja de conjunto; sus piezas van en SU plano
            If Not (jerarquico AndAlso mk <> "" AndAlso bs <> BOMStructureEnum.kPhantomBOMStructure AndAlso ConPlanoPropio(d)) Then Recorrer(occ.SubOccurrences)
        Else
            If mk = "" Then
                resumen.AppendLine("Sin marca (no se habilita): " & occ.Name)
                Continue For
            End If
            Sumar(cantParte, mk)
            If Not partDoc.ContainsKey(mk) Then
                partDoc(mk) = d
                Dim own As String = UProp(d, "CONJUNTO")
                If own = "" Then own = "SUELTAS"
                If Not partesDe.ContainsKey(own) Then partesDe(own) = New List(Of String)
                partesDe(own).Add(mk)
            End If
        End If
    Next
End Sub

Sub Sumar(dic As Dictionary(Of String, Integer), k As String)
    If dic.ContainsKey(k) Then dic(k) = dic(k) + 1 Else dic(k) = 1
End Sub

' ===================== hojas =====================
Function NuevaHoja(dwg As DrawingDocument) As Sheet
    Dim sh As Sheet = dwg.Sheets.Add(DrawingSheetSizeEnum.kA3DrawingSheetSize, PageOrientationTypeEnum.kLandscapePageOrientation)
    sh.Activate()
    Try
        If sh.Border Is Nothing Then
            sh.AddBorder(dwg.BorderDefinitions.Item(BORDE))
        ElseIf sh.Border.Name <> BORDE Then
            sh.Border.Delete()
            sh.AddBorder(dwg.BorderDefinitions.Item(BORDE))
        End If
    Catch
    End Try
    Try
        If sh.TitleBlock Is Nothing Then sh.AddTitleBlock(dwg.TitleBlockDefinitions.Item(ROTULO))
    Catch
    End Try
    Return sh
End Function

' ===================== sincronizacion =====================
Sub Sincronizar(dwg As DrawingDocument, asm As AssemblyDocument, existia As Boolean)
    ' orden deseado (jerarquia)
    Dim orden As New List(Of String)
    orden.Add("GA")
    For Each mk As String In conjOrden
        orden.Add("C|" & mk)
        For Each pm As String In ListaPartes(mk)
            orden.Add("H|" & pm)
        Next
    Next
    For Each own As String In New List(Of String)(partesDe.Keys)
        If conjDoc.ContainsKey(own) Then Continue For
        For Each pm As String In ListaPartes(own)
            orden.Add("H|" & pm)
        Next
    Next

    ' hojas existentes: generadas (con clave) y del usuario (ancladas a la anterior)
    Dim hojaDe As New Dictionary(Of String, Sheet)
    Dim usuario As New List(Of Sheet)
    Dim ancla As New List(Of String)
    If existia Then
        Dim ultima As String = "INICIO"
        For Each s As Sheet In dwg.Sheets
            Dim k As String = ClaveHoja(s)
            If k <> "" AndAlso k <> "REP" AndAlso Not hojaDe.ContainsKey(k) Then
                hojaDe(k) = s
                SetTag(s, "CLAVE", k)
                ultima = k
            Else
                usuario.Add(s)
                ancla.Add(ultima)
            End If
        Next
    End If

    ' crear o actualizar
    For Each k As String In orden
        If hojaDe.ContainsKey(k) Then
            Try
                Actualizar(hojaDe(k), k, asm)
                hActual.Add(Marca(k))
            Catch ex As Exception
                resumen.AppendLine("  no se pudo actualizar " & k & ": " & ex.Message)
            End Try
        Else
            Dim sh As Sheet
            If Not existia AndAlso k = "GA" Then
                sh = dwg.Sheets.Item(1)
            Else
                sh = NuevaHoja(dwg)
            End If
            Try
                Construir(sh, k, asm)
            Catch ex As Exception
                ' v2.11: una hoja que falla no detiene el juego; se borra y se reintenta la proxima vez
                resumen.AppendLine("  ERROR en la hoja " & k & ": " & ex.Message & "  (no se creo; vuelve a ejecutar)")
                errores.Add(Marca(k))
                Try
                    If dwg.Sheets.Count > 1 Then sh.Delete()
                Catch
                End Try
                Continue For
            End Try
            SetTag(sh, "CLAVE", k)
            hojaDe(k) = sh
            If existia Then hNuevas.Add(Marca(k))
        End If
    Next

    ' obsoletas: se renombran, no se borran
    Dim obsoletas As New List(Of String)
    Dim enArbol As HashSet(Of String) = If(jerarquico AndAlso existia, MarcasDelArbol(asm), Nothing)
    Dim trasladar As New List(Of String)
    For Each k As String In hojaDe.Keys
        If orden.Contains(k) Then Continue For
        ' v2.17: la marca sigue en el modelo pero su hoja ahora va en el plano de su conjunto
        If enArbol IsNot Nothing AndAlso k <> "GA" AndAlso enArbol.Contains(Marca(k)) Then
            trasladar.Add(k)
            Continue For
        End If
        obsoletas.Add(k)
        Dim s As Sheet = hojaDe(k)
        Dim base As String = NombreBase(s)
        If Not base.StartsWith("OBSOLETO") Then s.Name = "OBSOLETO " & base
        SetTag(s, "ESTADO", "OBSOLETO " & DateTime.Now.ToString("dd/MM/yyyy"))
        hObsol.Add(Marca(k))
    Next

    If trasladar.Count > 0 Then
        ' copia del plano tal como estaba guardado, luego se quitan esas hojas
        Try
            Dim sup As String = System.IO.Path.Combine(System.IO.Path.Combine(System.IO.Path.GetDirectoryName(dwg.FullFileName), "_SUPERADOS"), DateTime.Now.ToString("yyyyMMdd_HHmmss"))
            System.IO.Directory.CreateDirectory(sup)
            System.IO.File.Copy(dwg.FullFileName, System.IO.Path.Combine(sup, System.IO.Path.GetFileName(dwg.FullFileName)), True)
            Dim pdfV As String = System.IO.Path.ChangeExtension(dwg.FullFileName, ".pdf")
            If System.IO.File.Exists(pdfV) Then System.IO.File.Copy(pdfV, System.IO.Path.Combine(sup, System.IO.Path.GetFileName(pdfV)), True)
            resumen.AppendLine("Copia del plano anterior: " & sup)
            For Each k As String In trasladar
                Try
                    Dim s As Sheet = hojaDe(k)
                    hojaDe.Remove(k)
                    s.Delete()
                    hTras.Add(Marca(k))
                    resumen.AppendLine("  > " & k & ": pasa al plano de su conjunto (hoja quitada de este plano)")
                Catch ex2 As Exception
                    resumen.AppendLine("  no se pudo quitar la hoja " & k & ": " & ex2.Message)
                End Try
            Next
        Catch ex As Exception
            resumen.AppendLine("  no se pudo copiar el plano anterior (" & ex.Message & "): las hojas " & String.Join(", ", trasladar.ToArray()) & " se dejan")
        End Try
    End If

    ' orden final
    Dim final As New List(Of Sheet)
    AgregarAnclados(final, usuario, ancla, "INICIO")
    For Each k As String In orden
        ' v2.16: una hoja que no se pudo crear no esta en hojaDe; antes esto detenia la regla y no se guardaba nada
        If hojaDe.ContainsKey(k) Then final.Add(hojaDe(k))
        AgregarAnclados(final, usuario, ancla, k)
    Next
    For Each k As String In obsoletas
        final.Add(hojaDe(k))
        AgregarAnclados(final, usuario, ancla, k)
    Next
    For Each s As Sheet In usuario
        If Not final.Contains(s) Then final.Add(s)
    Next
    Reordenar(dwg, final)
    dwg.Sheets.Item(1).Activate()
End Sub

Sub AgregarAnclados(final As List(Of Sheet), usuario As List(Of Sheet), ancla As List(Of String), k As String)
    For i As Integer = 0 To usuario.Count - 1
        If ancla(i) = k AndAlso Not final.Contains(usuario(i)) Then final.Add(usuario(i))
    Next
End Sub

Sub Reordenar(dwg As DrawingDocument, final As List(Of Sheet))
    Try
        Dim pane As BrowserPane = PanelModelo(dwg)
        If Not (dwg.Sheets.Item(1) Is final(0)) Then
            pane.Reorder(pane.GetBrowserNodeFromObject(dwg.Sheets.Item(1)), True, pane.GetBrowserNodeFromObject(final(0)))
        End If
        For i As Integer = 1 To final.Count - 1
            pane.Reorder(pane.GetBrowserNodeFromObject(final(i - 1)), False, pane.GetBrowserNodeFromObject(final(i)))
        Next
    Catch ex As Exception
        resumen.AppendLine("  reordenar: " & ex.Message)
    End Try
End Sub

' Clave de una hoja: atributo, o se deduce del nombre (planos de la v1)
Function ClaveHoja(s As Sheet) As String
    Dim k As String = GetTag(s, "CLAVE")
    If k <> "" Then Return k
    Dim b As String = NombreBase(s)
    If b.StartsWith("DISPOSICION GENERAL") Then Return "GA"
    If b.StartsWith("CONJUNTO ") Then Return "C|" & b.Substring(9).Trim()
    If b.StartsWith("HABILITADO ") Then Return "H|" & b.Substring(11).Trim()
    Return ""
End Function

Function NombreBase(s As Sheet) As String
    Return System.Text.RegularExpressions.Regex.Replace(s.Name, ":\d+$", "")
End Function

Function Marca(k As String) As String
    If k = "GA" Then Return "GA"
    Return k.Substring(2)
End Function

Function ListaPartes(own As String) As List(Of String)
    Dim l As New List(Of String)
    If partesDe.ContainsKey(own) Then l.AddRange(partesDe(own))
    l.Sort(AddressOf CompararMarca)
    Return l
End Function

Function DocDeClave(k As String, asm As AssemblyDocument) As Document
    If k = "GA" Then Return asm
    If k.StartsWith("C|") Then Return conjDoc(Marca(k))
    Return partDoc(Marca(k))
End Function

' ===================== hojas nuevas =====================
Sub Construir(sh As Sheet, k As String, asm As AssemblyDocument)
    Dim d As Document = DocDeClave(k, asm)
    Dim den As Double
    Dim v() As DrawingView
    If k = "GA" Then
        sh.Name = NombreGA(asm)
        v = Vistas(sh, d, 2, 8.5, 25, YMAX, den)
        AcotarTotal(sh, v(0), True, True)
        AcotarTotal(sh, v(1), False, True)
        Dim pl As PartsList = ListaPiezas(sh, v(0), asm, PartsListLevelEnum.kStructured)
        modoGA = True
        Globos(sh, v(0), asm.ComponentDefinition.Occurrences, Nothing)
        modoGA = False
        Iso(sh, d, 26, 8.5, XMAX, LimiteInferior(pl))
    ElseIf k.StartsWith("C|") Then
        sh.Name = "CONJUNTO " & Marca(k)
        v = Vistas(sh, d, 2, 8.5, 25, YMAX, den)
        AcotarTotal(sh, v(0), True, True)
        AcotarTotal(sh, v(1), False, True)
        Dim pl As PartsList = ListaPiezas(sh, v(0), CType(d, AssemblyDocument), PartsListLevelEnum.kPartsOnly)
        Globos(sh, v(0), CType(d, AssemblyDocument).ComponentDefinition.Occurrences.AllLeafOccurrences, Nothing)
        Iso(sh, d, 26, 8.5, XMAX, LimiteInferior(pl))
    Else
        sh.Name = "HABILITADO " & Marca(k)
        Dim chapa As Boolean = ConDesarrollo(d)
        v = Vistas(sh, d, 2, 8.5, If(chapa, 25, 40), YMAX, den)
        AcotarTotal(sh, v(0), True, True)
        AcotarTotal(sh, v(1), False, True)
        AcotarTotal(sh, v(2), True, False)
        Agujeros(sh, v(0))
        If chapa Then Desarrollo(sh, d, 26, 8.5, XMAX, YMAX)
    End If
    SetTag(v(0), "BASE", "SI")
    Dim nt As GeneralNote = Nota(sh, TextoNota(k, asm, den))
    NotaFabricacion(sh, k, asm)
    resumen.AppendLine("  + " & k & "  escala 1:" & den)
End Sub

' ===================== hojas existentes =====================
' Solo nota y globos. Vistas, cotas, lista y lo agregado a mano no se tocan.
Sub Actualizar(sh As Sheet, k As String, asm As AssemblyDocument)
    If k = "GA" Then
        Try
            If NombreBase(sh) <> NombreGA(asm) Then sh.Name = NombreGA(asm)
        Catch
        End Try
    End If
    Dim d As Document = DocDeClave(k, asm)
    ' v2.9: rehacer=SI -> todas las hojas de la regla se rehacen (vistas nuevas, p.ej. ejes propios)
    If Arg("rehacer").ToUpper() = "SI" Then
        LimpiarHoja(sh)
        Construir(sh, k, asm)
        resumen.AppendLine("  ~ " & k & ": hoja rehecha (rehacer=SI)")
        Exit Sub
    End If
    Dim b As String = NombreBase(sh)
    If b.StartsWith("OBSOLETO ") Then
        sh.Name = b.Substring(9)
        SetTag(sh, "ESTADO", "")
    End If
    Dim v As DrawingView = VistaBase(sh, d)
    ' v2.10: modelo GIRADO (STEP / referencia torcida) y la hoja vieja lo dibujo en los ejes del
    ' ensamble -> la hoja se rehace sola con las vistas en los ejes propios del modelo
    If v IsNot Nothing AndAlso Not RuleArguments.Exists("no_reencuadrar") AndAlso VistaTorcida(v, d) Then
        LimpiarHoja(sh)
        Construir(sh, k, asm)
        resumen.AppendLine("  ~ " & k & ": el modelo esta girado; hoja rehecha con sus ejes propios")
        Exit Sub
    End If
    ' el modelo crecio: si las vistas ya no entran a su escala, se rehace la hoja
    If v IsNot Nothing AndAlso Not RuleArguments.Exists("no_reencuadrar") Then
        Dim nec As Double = DenNecesario(d, 2, 8.5, If(k.StartsWith("H|") AndAlso Not ConDesarrollo(d), 40, 25), YMAX)
        Dim act As Double = Math.Round(1 / v.Scale, 1)
        If act < nec - 0.01 Then
            LimpiarHoja(sh)
            Construir(sh, k, asm)
            resumen.AppendLine("  ~ " & k & ": el modelo crecio (a 1:" & act & " ya no entra), hoja rehecha")
            Exit Sub
        End If
    End If
    If k.StartsWith("H|") AndAlso Arg("desarrollo").ToLower() = "rehacer" AndAlso ConDesarrollo(d) AndAlso VistaDesarrollo(sh) Is Nothing Then
        LimpiarHoja(sh)
        Construir(sh, k, asm)
        resumen.AppendLine("  ~ " & k & ": hoja rehecha con el desarrollo")
        Exit Sub
    End If
    Dim den As Double = 1
    If v IsNot Nothing Then den = Math.Round(1 / v.Scale, 1)
    ' chapa sin desarrollo en la hoja: se agrega en el espacio libre de la derecha
    If k.StartsWith("H|") AndAlso ConDesarrollo(d) AndAlso VistaDesarrollo(sh) Is Nothing Then
        Dim xLibre As Double = 0
        For Each dv As DrawingView In sh.DrawingViews
            xLibre = Math.Max(xLibre, dv.Left + dv.Width)
        Next
        If XMAX - xLibre - 1.5 >= 6 Then
            Desarrollo(sh, d, xLibre + 1.5, 8.5, XMAX, YMAX)
        Else
            resumen.AppendLine("  ! " & k & ": chapa sin desarrollo y sin espacio libre en la hoja (ejecuta con desarrollo=rehacer)")
        End If
    End If
    ' referencias agregadas despues (skeleton, equipo existente): ocultas en todas las vistas
    For Each dv As DrawingView In sh.DrawingViews
        Try
            OcultarRef(dv, dv.ReferencedDocumentDescriptor.ReferencedDocument)
        Catch
        End Try
    Next
    ' nota
    Dim txt As String = TextoNota(k, asm, den)
    Dim vieja As GeneralNote = Nothing
    For Each gn As GeneralNote In sh.DrawingNotes.GeneralNotes
        If GetTag(gn, "NOTA") = "SI" OrElse gn.Text.StartsWith("PROYECTO:") OrElse gn.Text.StartsWith("CONJUNTO:") OrElse gn.Text.StartsWith("HABILITADO:") Then
            vieja = gn
            Exit For
        End If
    Next
    If vieja Is Nothing Then
        Nota(sh, txt)
    ElseIf vieja.Text.Replace(vbCr, "").Replace(vbLf, "") <> txt.Replace(vbCr, "").Replace(vbLf, "") Then
        Dim pos As Point2d = vieja.Position
        vieja.Delete()
        Dim nn As GeneralNote = sh.DrawingNotes.GeneralNotes.AddFitted(pos, txt)
        SetTag(nn, "NOTA", "SI")
    End If
    NotaFabricacion(sh, k, asm)
    ' globos: marca actual en los existentes + globos de marcas nuevas
    Dim hechos As New List(Of String)
    For Each bl As Balloon In sh.Balloons
        For Each bvs As BalloonValueSet In bl.BalloonValueSets
            Try
                Dim bd As Document = bvs.ReferencedRow.BOMRow.ComponentDefinitions.Item(1).Document
                Dim mk As String = UProp(bd, "MARCA")
                If mk <> "" Then
                    If bvs.OverrideValue <> mk Then bvs.OverrideValue = mk
                    If Not hechos.Contains(mk) Then hechos.Add(mk)
                End If
            Catch
            End Try
        Next
    Next
    If v IsNot Nothing AndAlso Not k.StartsWith("H|") Then
        If k = "GA" Then
            modoGA = True
            Globos(sh, v, asm.ComponentDefinition.Occurrences, hechos)
            modoGA = False
        Else
            Globos(sh, v, CType(d, AssemblyDocument).ComponentDefinition.Occurrences.AllLeafOccurrences, hechos)
        End If
    End If
End Sub

' Ocurrencia de equipo (EQUIPO = SI) que contiene a occ, o Nothing
Function EquipoDe(occ As ComponentOccurrence) As ComponentOccurrence
    Dim o As ComponentOccurrence = occ
    Dim n As Integer = 0
    Do While o IsNot Nothing AndAlso n < 20
        Try
            If UProp(o.Definition.Document, "EQUIPO").ToUpper() = "SI" Then Return o
        Catch
        End Try
        o = o.ParentOccurrence
        n = n + 1
    Loop
    Return Nothing
End Function

Function PropInst(occ As ComponentOccurrence, n As String) As String
    Try
        Dim nat As ComponentOccurrence = occ
        Try
            If occ.ParentOccurrence IsNot Nothing Then nat = CType(occ, ComponentOccurrenceProxy).NativeObject
        Catch
        End Try
        If Not nat.OccurrencePropertySetsEnabled Then Return ""
        Return CStr(nat.OccurrencePropertySets.Item(1).Item(n).Value)
    Catch
        Return ""
    End Try
End Function

Function VistaBase(sh As Sheet, d As Document) As DrawingView
    Dim prim As DrawingView = Nothing
    For Each v As DrawingView In sh.DrawingViews
        If GetTag(v, "BASE") = "SI" Then Return v
        Try
            If prim Is Nothing AndAlso v.ReferencedDocumentDescriptor.ReferencedDocument Is d Then prim = v
        Catch
        End Try
    Next
    If prim Is Nothing AndAlso sh.DrawingViews.Count > 0 Then prim = sh.DrawingViews.Item(1)
    Return prim
End Function

Function TextoNota(k As String, asm As AssemblyDocument, den As Double) As String
    Dim t As String
    If k = "GA" Then
        Dim peso As Double = 0
        For Each occ As ComponentOccurrence In asm.ComponentDefinition.Occurrences
            Try
                If Not occ.Suppressed AndAlso occ.BOMStructure <> BOMStructureEnum.kReferenceBOMStructure Then peso = peso + Num(UProp(occ.Definition.Document, "PESO"))
            Catch
            End Try
        Next
        t = "PROYECTO: " & proy & "     PLANTA: " & planta & "     ENSAMBLE: " & System.IO.Path.GetFileNameWithoutExtension(asm.FullFileName) & vbCrLf
        t = t & "CONJUNTOS: " & conjOrden.Count & " tipos     PIEZAS DE HABILITADO: " & partDoc.Count & " marcas" & vbCrLf
        t = t & "PESO TOTAL (sin perneria): " & peso.ToString("0.0") & " kg     ESCALA 1:" & den
        If UProp(asm, "TIPO_ENSAMBLE").ToUpper() <> "PLANTA" AndAlso UProp(asm, "PREFIJO") <> "" Then
            Dim nq As Integer = CantidadEnFase(asm)
            t = t & vbCrLf & "CANT. DE CONJUNTOS EN LA FASE: " & nq & If(nq > 1, "  ->  fabricar TODAS las piezas x " & nq & " (cantidad de la lista por conjunto)", "")
        End If
    ElseIf k.StartsWith("C|") Then
        Dim mk As String = Marca(k)
        Dim d As Document = conjDoc(mk)
        Dim n As Integer = cantConj(mk)
        Dim pu As Double = Num(UProp(d, "PESO"))
        Dim per As String = UProp(d, "PERNERIA")
        If per = "" Then per = "NO REQUIERE"
        t = "CONJUNTO: " & mk & "     " & DProp(d, "Description") & "     CANT.: " & n & vbCrLf
        If jerarquico AndAlso ConPlanoPropio(d) Then
            t = t & "DETALLE Y HABILITADOS EN PLANO: " & NomBase(planta, System.IO.Path.GetFileNameWithoutExtension(d.FullFileName)) & "-FAB  (carpeta " & System.IO.Path.GetFileNameWithoutExtension(d.FullFileName) & "\PLANOS)" & vbCrLf
        ElseIf UProp(asm, "TIPO_ENSAMBLE").ToUpper() <> "PLANTA" AndAlso UProp(asm, "PREFIJO") <> "" Then
            t = t & "SUBCONJUNTO: ver plano " & System.IO.Path.GetFileNameWithoutExtension(d.FullFileName) & "-FAB" & vbCrLf
        End If
        t = t & "PESO UNIT.: " & pu.ToString("0.00") & " kg     PESO TOTAL: " & (pu * n).ToString("0.00") & " kg     ESCALA 1:" & den & vbCrLf
        t = t & "PERNERIA (por conjunto): " & per & vbCrLf
        Dim pa As String = UProp(d, "PERTENECE_A")
        If pa <> "" Then t = t & "PERTENECE A: " & pa & "     RUTA: " & UProp(d, "RUTA") & vbCrLf
        If UProp(d, "TAGS") <> "" Then t = t & "TAG: " & UProp(d, "TAGS") & "  (+ globo)" & vbCrLf
        t = t & "MODELO: " & System.IO.Path.GetFileName(d.FullFileName)
    Else
        Dim mk As String = Marca(k)
        Dim d As Document = partDoc(mk)
        Dim n As Integer = cantParte(mk)
        Dim own As String = UProp(d, "CONJUNTO")
        Dim pu As Double = Num(UProp(d, "PESO"))
        Dim pa As String = UProp(d, "PERTENECE_A")
        If pa = "" Then pa = own
        t = "HABILITADO: " & mk & "     CANT.: " & n & " (planta " & planta & ")     PERTENECE A: " & pa & vbCrLf
        Dim miMk As String = UProp(asm, "MARCA")
        If miMk <> "" AndAlso own <> "" AndAlso own <> miMk AndAlso UProp(asm, "TIPO_ENSAMBLE").ToUpper() <> "PLANTA" Then t = t & "PIEZA COMPARTIDA: MARCA DE " & own & " (se fabrica una sola vez, no duplicar)" & vbCrLf
        t = t & "PERFIL: " & DProp(d, "Description") & "     LONG.: " & UProp(d, "LONGITUD") & " mm     MATERIAL: " & UProp(d, "GRADO") & vbCrLf
        t = t & "PESO UNIT.: " & pu.ToString("0.00") & " kg     PESO TOTAL: " & (pu * n).ToString("0.00") & " kg     ESCALA 1:" & den & vbCrLf
        t = t & "MODELO: " & System.IO.Path.GetFileName(d.FullFileName)
    End If
    Return t
End Function

' ===================== notas de fabricacion =====================
Sub NotaFabricacion(sh As Sheet, k As String, asm As AssemblyDocument)
    Try
        If notasFab Is Nothing Then CargarNotasFab(asm)
        Dim sec As String = "GENERAL"
        If k.StartsWith("C|") Then sec = "CONJUNTO"
        If k.StartsWith("H|") Then sec = "HABILITADO"
        Dim txt As String = ""
        If notasFab.ContainsKey(sec) Then txt = notasFab(sec)
        Dim vieja As GeneralNote = Nothing
        For Each gn As GeneralNote In sh.DrawingNotes.GeneralNotes
            If GetTag(gn, "NOTA") = "FAB" Then
                vieja = gn
                Exit For
            End If
        Next
        If vieja IsNot Nothing Then
            If vieja.Text.Replace(vbCr, "").Replace(vbLf, "") = txt.Replace(vbCr, "").Replace(vbLf, "") Then Exit Sub
            vieja.Delete()
        End If
        If txt = "" Then Exit Sub
        Dim nn As GeneralNote = sh.DrawingNotes.GeneralNotes.AddFitted(TG.CreatePoint2d(24.5, 7.4), txt)
        SetTag(nn, "NOTA", "FAB")
    Catch ex As Exception
        resumen.AppendLine("  nota fabricacion: " & ex.Message)
    End Try
End Sub

' Corre ESTILO_PLANO sobre el plano (sin guardar ni rehacer las listas: GENERAR guarda despues)
Sub AplicarEstilo(dwg As DrawingDocument, asm As AssemblyDocument)
    Dim regla As String = RutaRegla("ESTILO_PLANO")
    Dim dir As String = System.IO.Path.GetDirectoryName(asm.FullFileName)
    For lvl As Integer = 0 To 6
        If dir Is Nothing Then Exit For
        For Each sd As String In New String() {"", "iLogic", "plantillas"}
            Dim p As String = System.IO.Path.Combine(System.IO.Path.Combine(dir, sd), "ESTILO_PLANO.iLogicVb")
            If regla = "" AndAlso System.IO.File.Exists(p) Then regla = p
        Next
        dir = System.IO.Path.GetDirectoryName(dir)
    Next
    If regla = "" Then
        resumen.AppendLine("  (sin ESTILO_PLANO.iLogicVb: el plano queda con los estilos de la plantilla)")
        Exit Sub
    End If
    Try
        Dim m As NameValueMap = ThisApplication.TransientObjects.CreateNameValueMap()
        m.Add("silencioso", "1")
        m.Add("no_guardar", "1")
        m.Add("sin_listas", "1")
        Dim r As Integer = iLogicVb.Automation.RunExternalRuleWithArguments(dwg, regla, m)
        resumen.AppendLine("Estilo COIMSER aplicado (" & regla & ")" & If(r <> 0, "  codigo " & r, ""))
    Catch ex As Exception
        resumen.AppendLine("  no se pudo aplicar ESTILO_PLANO: " & ex.Message)
    End Try
End Sub

Sub CargarNotasFab(asm As AssemblyDocument)
    notasFab = New Dictionary(Of String, String)
    Dim archivo As String = ""
    ' 1) notas propias de la obra (carpeta del ensamble hasta la de la obra)
    Dim dObra As String = System.IO.Path.GetDirectoryName(asm.FullFileName)
    For lvl As Integer = 0 To 6
        If dObra Is Nothing OrElse dObra = "" OrElse archivo <> "" Then Exit For
        For Each sd As String In New String() {"", "plantillas"}
            Dim p As String = System.IO.Path.Combine(System.IO.Path.Combine(dObra, sd), "NOTAS_FABRICACION.txt")
            If archivo = "" AndAlso System.IO.File.Exists(p) Then archivo = p
        Next
        If System.IO.File.Exists(System.IO.Path.Combine(dObra, "_OBRA.txt")) Then Exit For
        dObra = System.IO.Path.GetDirectoryName(dObra)
    Next
    ' 2) las de la carpeta de reglas (Git)
    If archivo = "" Then archivo = RutaRegla("NOTAS_FABRICACION.txt")
    Dim dir As String = System.IO.Path.GetDirectoryName(asm.FullFileName)
    For lvl As Integer = 0 To 6
        If dir Is Nothing Then Exit For
        For Each sd As String In New String() {"", "iLogic", "plantillas"}
            Dim p As String = System.IO.Path.Combine(System.IO.Path.Combine(dir, sd), "NOTAS_FABRICACION.txt")
            If archivo = "" AndAlso System.IO.File.Exists(p) Then archivo = p
        Next
        dir = System.IO.Path.GetDirectoryName(dir)
    Next
    If archivo = "" Then
        resumen.AppendLine("  (sin NOTAS_FABRICACION.txt: no se agregan notas de fabricacion)")
        Exit Sub
    End If
    Dim sec As String = ""
    Dim sb As New System.Text.StringBuilder
    For Each ln As String In System.IO.File.ReadAllLines(archivo, System.Text.Encoding.UTF8)
        Dim t As String = ln.TrimEnd()
        If t.StartsWith("[") AndAlso t.EndsWith("]") Then
            If sec <> "" Then notasFab(sec) = sb.ToString().Trim()
            sec = t.Trim("["c, "]"c).ToUpper()
            sb.Clear()
        ElseIf sec <> "" AndAlso Not t.StartsWith("#") Then
            sb.AppendLine(t)
        End If
    Next
    If sec <> "" Then notasFab(sec) = sb.ToString().Trim()
    resumen.AppendLine("Notas de fabricacion: " & archivo)
End Sub

' ===================== atributos (identifican hojas, vistas y notas) =====================
Function GetTag(o As Object, n As String) As String
    Try
        Dim sets As AttributeSets = o.AttributeSets
        If sets.NameIsUsed(ATR) Then
            Dim a As AttributeSet = sets.Item(ATR)
            If a.NameIsUsed(n) Then Return CStr(a.Item(n).Value)
        End If
    Catch
    End Try
    Return ""
End Function

Sub SetTag(o As Object, n As String, v As String)
    Try
        Dim sets As AttributeSets = o.AttributeSets
        Dim a As AttributeSet
        If sets.NameIsUsed(ATR) Then
            a = sets.Item(ATR)
        Else
            a = sets.Add(ATR)
        End If
        If a.NameIsUsed(n) Then
            a.Item(n).Value = v
        Else
            a.Add(n, ValueTypeEnum.kStringType, v)
        End If
    Catch ex As Exception
        resumen.AppendLine("  atributo " & n & ": " & ex.Message)
    End Try
End Sub

Function EnsambleDelPlano(dwg As DrawingDocument) As AssemblyDocument
    Dim r As String = GetTag(dwg, "ENSAMBLE")
    If r <> "" AndAlso System.IO.File.Exists(r) Then
        For Each od As Document In ThisApplication.Documents
            If String.Compare(od.FullFileName, r, True) = 0 Then Return TryCast(od, AssemblyDocument)
        Next
        Return TryCast(ThisApplication.Documents.Open(r, False), AssemblyDocument)
    End If
    Try
        For Each s As Sheet In dwg.Sheets
            If NombreBase(s).StartsWith("DISPOSICION GENERAL") Then
                Return TryCast(s.DrawingViews.Item(1).ReferencedDocumentDescriptor.ReferencedDocument, AssemblyDocument)
            End If
        Next
    Catch
    End Try
    Return Nothing
End Function


' ===================== vistas =====================
' Base con la mayor dimension horizontal, proyectada debajo y a la derecha.
Function Vistas(sh As Sheet, d As Document, x0 As Double, y0 As Double, x1 As Double, y1 As Double, ByRef den As Double) As DrawingView()
    ' v2.9: ejes PROPIOS del modelo (si vino girado de un STEP, las vistas se alinean con el)
    Dim ejes() As UnitVector = Nothing
    Dim ext() As Double = Nothing
    Dim c As Point = Nothing
    Marco(d, ejes, ext, c)
    Dim iLg As Integer = 0
    For i As Integer = 1 To 2
        If ext(i) > ext(iLg) Then iLg = i
    Next
    Dim iSm As Integer = If(iLg = 0, 1, 0)
    For i As Integer = 0 To 2
        If i <> iLg AndAlso ext(i) < ext(iSm) Then iSm = i
    Next
    Dim iMd As Integer = 3 - iLg - iSm
    Dim Lg As Double = ext(iLg)
    Dim Md As Double = ext(iMd)
    Dim Sm As Double = ext(iSm)
    Dim gap As Double = 2.2
    den = DenNecesario(d, x0, y0, x1, y1)
    Dim sc As Double = 1 / den
    Dim vSm As UnitVector = ejes(iSm)
    Dim cam As Camera = ThisApplication.TransientObjects.CreateCamera()
    cam.Target = c
    cam.Eye = TG.CreatePoint(c.X + vSm.X * 1000, c.Y + vSm.Y * 1000, c.Z + vSm.Z * 1000)
    cam.UpVector = ejes(iMd)
    Dim bx As Double = x0 + gap + Lg * sc / 2
    Dim by As Double = y1 - gap - Md * sc / 2
    Dim v As DrawingView = sh.DrawingViews.AddBaseView(d, TG.CreatePoint2d(bx, by), sc, ViewOrientationTypeEnum.kArbitraryViewOrientation, DrawingViewStyleEnum.kHiddenLineRemovedDrawingViewStyle, "", cam)
    Dim vb As DrawingView = Proyectar(sh, v, TG.CreatePoint2d(bx, by - Md * sc / 2 - gap - Sm * sc / 2))
    Dim vr As DrawingView = Proyectar(sh, v, TG.CreatePoint2d(bx + Lg * sc / 2 + gap + Sm * sc / 2, by))
    OcultarRef(v, d) : OcultarRef(vb, d) : OcultarRef(vr, d)
    Return New DrawingView() {v, vb, vr}
End Function

' v2.11: vista proyectada de una base con camara propia. Inventor a veces aun no termino de
' calcular la vista base girada y AddProjectedView falla con "El parametro no es correcto":
' se fuerza el calculo de la base (leer su tamano) y se reintenta.
Function Proyectar(sh As Sheet, v As DrawingView, pt As Point2d) As DrawingView
    Dim ultimo As Exception = Nothing
    For intento As Integer = 1 To 4
        Try
            Dim w As Double = v.Width + v.Height + v.Center.X
            If intento > 1 Then
                Try : ThisApplication.UserInterfaceManager.DoEvents() : Catch : End Try
                Try : sh.Update() : Catch : End Try
                System.Threading.Thread.Sleep(200 * intento)
            End If
            Return sh.DrawingViews.AddProjectedView(v, pt, DrawingViewStyleEnum.kFromBaseDrawingViewStyle)
        Catch ex As Exception
            ultimo = ex
        End Try
    Next
    Throw New Exception("no se pudo proyectar la vista de " & v.Name & " (" & ultimo.Message & ")")
End Function

' Escala normalizada (1:den) con la que las 3 vistas del modelo entran en la zona dada
Function DenNecesario(d As Document, x0 As Double, y0 As Double, x1 As Double, y1 As Double) As Double
    Dim ej() As UnitVector = Nothing, ex() As Double = Nothing, cc As Point = Nothing
    Marco(d, ej, ex, cc)
    Dim e() As Double = {ex(0), ex(1), ex(2)}
    Array.Sort(e)
    Dim Sm As Double = e(0), Md As Double = e(1), Lg As Double = e(2)
    Dim gap As Double = 2.2
    Dim dens() As Double = {1, 2, 2.5, 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 30, 40, 50, 75, 100, 150, 200, 250}
    For Each dd As Double In dens
        If (Lg + Sm) / dd + 3 * gap <= (x1 - x0) AndAlso (Md + Sm) / dd + 3 * gap <= (y1 - y0) Then Return dd
    Next
    Return 250
End Function

' Borra vistas, listas y notas de la regla de una hoja (para rehacerla)
Sub LimpiarHoja(sh As Sheet)
    ' todas las vistas, de la ultima a la primera (las proyectadas quedan sueltas si solo se borra la base)
    For i As Integer = sh.DrawingViews.Count To 1 Step -1
        Try
            sh.DrawingViews.Item(i).Delete()
        Catch
        End Try
    Next
    Dim pls As New List(Of PartsList)
    For Each pl As PartsList In sh.PartsLists
        pls.Add(pl)
    Next
    For Each pl As PartsList In pls
        Try : pl.Delete() : Catch : End Try
    Next
    Dim ns As New List(Of GeneralNote)
    For Each gn As GeneralNote In sh.DrawingNotes.GeneralNotes
        If GetTag(gn, "NOTA") <> "" OrElse gn.Text.StartsWith("PROYECTO:") OrElse gn.Text.StartsWith("CONJUNTO:") OrElse gn.Text.StartsWith("HABILITADO:") Then ns.Add(gn)
    Next
    For Each gn As GeneralNote In ns
        Try : gn.Delete() : Catch : End Try
    Next
End Sub

Sub Iso(sh As Sheet, d As Document, x0 As Double, y0 As Double, x1 As Double, y1 As Double)
    Try
        If y1 - y0 < 4 OrElse x1 - x0 < 4 Then Exit Sub
        Dim rb As Box = Caja(d)
        Dim diag As Double = rb.MinPoint.DistanceTo(rb.MaxPoint)
        Dim lado As Double = Math.Min(x1 - x0, y1 - y0) - 1
        Dim dens() As Double = {1, 2, 2.5, 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 30, 40, 50, 75, 100, 150, 200, 250}
        Dim den As Double = 250
        For Each dd As Double In dens
            If diag / dd <= lado Then
                den = dd
                Exit For
            End If
        Next
        Dim vi As DrawingView = sh.DrawingViews.AddBaseView(d, TG.CreatePoint2d((x0 + x1) / 2, (y0 + y1) / 2), 1 / den, ViewOrientationTypeEnum.kIsoTopRightViewOrientation, DrawingViewStyleEnum.kHiddenLineRemovedDrawingViewStyle)
        OcultarRef(vi, d)
    Catch ex As Exception
        resumen.AppendLine("  iso: " & ex.Message)
    End Try
End Sub

' ===================== lista y globos =====================
Function ListaPiezas(sh As Sheet, v As DrawingView, d As AssemblyDocument, nivel As PartsListLevelEnum) As PartsList
    Try
        Dim bom As BOM = d.ComponentDefinition.BOM
        If nivel = PartsListLevelEnum.kPartsOnly Then
            If Not bom.PartsOnlyViewEnabled Then bom.PartsOnlyViewEnabled = True
        Else
            If Not bom.StructuredViewEnabled Then bom.StructuredViewEnabled = True
            If Not bom.StructuredViewFirstLevelOnly Then bom.StructuredViewFirstLevelOnly = True
        End If
    Catch
    End Try
    Dim pl As PartsList = sh.PartsLists.Add(v, TG.CreatePoint2d(26, YMAX), nivel)
    AjustarColumnas(pl)
    Dim r As Box2d = pl.RangeBox
    pl.Position = TG.CreatePoint2d(pl.Position.X + (XMAX - r.MaxPoint.X), pl.Position.Y + (YMAX - r.MaxPoint.Y))
    Try
        pl.Sort("MARCA")
        pl.Renumber()
    Catch
    End Try
    Return pl
End Function

' Ancho de columna segun el texto mas largo (titulo repartido en 2 lineas)
Sub AjustarColumnas(pl As PartsList)
    Try
        Dim h As Double = pl.DataTextStyle.FontSize * 10
        For i As Integer = 1 To pl.PartsListColumns.Count
            Dim c As PartsListColumn = pl.PartsListColumns.Item(i)
            Dim t As String = c.Title.Replace(vbCrLf, " ").Replace(vbLf, " ").Trim()
            Dim maxc As Integer = t.Length
            For k As Integer = 1 To t.Length - 2
                If t(k) = " "c Then maxc = Math.Min(maxc, Math.Max(k, t.Length - k - 1))
            Next
            For Each rw As PartsListRow In pl.PartsListRows
                Try
                    maxc = Math.Max(maxc, rw.Item(i).Value.Length)
                Catch
                End Try
            Next
            c.Width = Math.Max(1.0, (maxc * h * 0.8 + 3) / 10)
        Next
    Catch
    End Try
End Sub

Function LimiteInferior(pl As PartsList) As Double
    Try
        Return pl.RangeBox.MinPoint.Y - 0.8
    Catch
        Return 18
    End Try
End Function

Sub Globos(sh As Sheet, v As DrawingView, occs As Object, previos As List(Of String))
    Dim hechos As New List(Of String)
    If previos IsNot Nothing Then hechos.AddRange(previos)
    For Each occ As ComponentOccurrence In occs
        Try
            If occ.Suppressed Then Continue For
            If occ.BOMStructure = BOMStructureEnum.kReferenceBOMStructure Then Continue For
            If DentroDeRef(occ) Then Continue For
            Dim mk As String = UProp(occ.Definition.Document, "MARCA")
            ' equipos: globo con su TAG (TAG_EQUIPOS); si la hoja es de un sistema, el TAG local (MOT-01)
            Dim eq As ComponentOccurrence = EquipoDe(occ)
            If eq IsNot Nothing Then
                mk = PropInst(eq, If(modoGA, "TAG", "TAG_LOCAL"))
                If mk = "" Then mk = UProp(eq.Definition.Document, "TIPO_EQUIPO")
                If mk = "" Then mk = "EQUIPO"
            End If
            If mk = "" OrElse hechos.Contains(mk) Then Continue For
            Dim curvas As DrawingCurvesEnumerator = v.DrawingCurves(occ)
            If curvas Is Nothing OrElse curvas.Count = 0 Then Continue For
            Dim cv As DrawingCurve = Nothing
            For Each cc As DrawingCurve In curvas
                If cc.CurveType = CurveTypeEnum.kLineSegmentCurve Then
                    cv = cc
                    Exit For
                End If
            Next
            Dim circular As Boolean = False
            If cv Is Nothing Then
                ' piezas redondas (motores, ejes): usar un circulo o arco
                For Each cc As DrawingCurve In curvas
                    If cc.CurveType = CurveTypeEnum.kCircleCurve OrElse cc.CurveType = CurveTypeEnum.kCircularArcCurve Then
                        cv = cc
                        circular = True
                        Exit For
                    End If
                Next
            End If
            If cv Is Nothing Then Continue For
            Dim m As Point2d
            If circular Then
                Dim rb2 As Box2d = cv.Evaluator2D.RangeBox
                m = TG.CreatePoint2d((rb2.MinPoint.X + rb2.MaxPoint.X) / 2, rb2.MaxPoint.Y)
            Else
                m = cv.MidPoint
            End If
            Dim dx As Double = m.X - v.Center.X
            Dim dy As Double = m.Y - v.Center.Y
            Dim ln As Double = Math.Sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy)
            If ln < 0.01 Then
                dx = 1
                dy = 1
                ln = 1.414
            End If
            Dim pts As ObjectCollection = ThisApplication.TransientObjects.CreateObjectCollection()
            Dim bxp As Double = Math.Max(3.0, Math.Min(XMAX - 2, m.X + dx / ln * 2.5 + 0.6 * hechos.Count))
            Dim byp As Double = Math.Max(9.0, Math.Min(YMAX - 1, m.Y + dy / ln * 2.5 + 0.4))
            pts.Add(TG.CreatePoint2d(bxp, byp))
            pts.Add(sh.CreateGeometryIntent(cv, If(circular, PointIntentEnum.kCircularTopPointIntent, PointIntentEnum.kMidPointIntent)))
            Dim b As Balloon = sh.Balloons.Add(pts)
            For Each bvs As BalloonValueSet In b.BalloonValueSets
                bvs.OverrideValue = mk
            Next
            hechos.Add(mk)
        Catch ex As Exception
            resumen.AppendLine("  globo " & occ.Name & ": " & ex.Message)
        End Try
    Next
End Sub

' ===================== cotas =====================
Sub AcotarTotal(sh As Sheet, v As DrawingView, horiz As Boolean, vert As Boolean)
    Try
        Dim cMinX As DrawingCurve = Nothing, cMaxX As DrawingCurve = Nothing, cMinY As DrawingCurve = Nothing, cMaxY As DrawingCurve = Nothing
        Dim iMinX, iMaxX, iMinY, iMaxY As PointIntentEnum
        Dim minX As Double = 1.0E+30, maxX As Double = -1.0E+30, minY As Double = 1.0E+30, maxY As Double = -1.0E+30
        For Each cv As DrawingCurve In v.DrawingCurves
            If cv.CurveType <> CurveTypeEnum.kLineSegmentCurve Then Continue For
            For k As Integer = 0 To 1
                Dim p As Point2d = If(k = 0, cv.StartPoint, cv.EndPoint)
                Dim it As PointIntentEnum = If(k = 0, PointIntentEnum.kStartPointIntent, PointIntentEnum.kEndPointIntent)
                If p.X < minX - 0.0001 Then
                    minX = p.X : cMinX = cv : iMinX = it
                End If
                If p.X > maxX + 0.0001 Then
                    maxX = p.X : cMaxX = cv : iMaxX = it
                End If
                If p.Y < minY - 0.0001 Then
                    minY = p.Y : cMinY = cv : iMinY = it
                End If
                If p.Y > maxY + 0.0001 Then
                    maxY = p.Y : cMaxY = cv : iMaxY = it
                End If
            Next
        Next
        Dim gd As GeneralDimensions = sh.DrawingDimensions.GeneralDimensions
        If horiz AndAlso cMinX IsNot Nothing AndAlso maxX - minX > 0.05 Then
            gd.AddLinear(TG.CreatePoint2d((minX + maxX) / 2, maxY + 1.6), sh.CreateGeometryIntent(cMinX, iMinX), sh.CreateGeometryIntent(cMaxX, iMaxX), DimensionTypeEnum.kHorizontalDimensionType)
        End If
        If vert AndAlso cMinY IsNot Nothing AndAlso maxY - minY > 0.05 Then
            gd.AddLinear(TG.CreatePoint2d(minX - 1.6, (minY + maxY) / 2), sh.CreateGeometryIntent(cMinY, iMinY), sh.CreateGeometryIntent(cMaxY, iMaxY), DimensionTypeEnum.kVerticalDimensionType)
        End If
    Catch ex As Exception
        resumen.AppendLine("  cota total: " & ex.Message)
    End Try
End Sub

' Agujeros: cotas ordinales desde el extremo izquierdo / inferior y un diametro por tamano.
Sub Agujeros(sh As Sheet, v As DrawingView)
    Try
        Dim circs As New List(Of DrawingCurve)
        Dim cIzq As DrawingCurve = Nothing, cAba As DrawingCurve = Nothing
        Dim iIzq, iAba As PointIntentEnum
        Dim minX As Double = 1.0E+30, minY As Double = 1.0E+30, maxY As Double = -1.0E+30
        For Each cv As DrawingCurve In v.DrawingCurves
            If cv.CurveType = CurveTypeEnum.kCircleCurve Then
                circs.Add(cv)
            ElseIf cv.CurveType = CurveTypeEnum.kLineSegmentCurve Then
                For k As Integer = 0 To 1
                    Dim p As Point2d = If(k = 0, cv.StartPoint, cv.EndPoint)
                    Dim it As PointIntentEnum = If(k = 0, PointIntentEnum.kStartPointIntent, PointIntentEnum.kEndPointIntent)
                    If p.X < minX - 0.0001 Then
                        minX = p.X : cIzq = cv : iIzq = it
                    End If
                    If p.Y < minY - 0.0001 Then
                        minY = p.Y : cAba = cv : iAba = it
                    End If
                    If p.Y > maxY Then maxY = p.Y
                Next
            End If
        Next
        If circs.Count = 0 OrElse cIzq Is Nothing Then Exit Sub
        Dim xs As New List(Of Double), ys As New List(Of Double), rs As New List(Of Double)
        Dim colX As ObjectCollection = ThisApplication.TransientObjects.CreateObjectCollection()
        Dim colY As ObjectCollection = ThisApplication.TransientObjects.CreateObjectCollection()
        colX.Add(sh.CreateGeometryIntent(cIzq, iIzq))
        colY.Add(sh.CreateGeometryIntent(cAba, iAba))
        Dim gd As GeneralDimensions = sh.DrawingDimensions.GeneralDimensions
        For Each cv As DrawingCurve In circs
            Dim cp As Point2d = cv.CenterPoint
            If Not Contiene(xs, cp.X) Then
                xs.Add(cp.X)
                colX.Add(sh.CreateGeometryIntent(cv, PointIntentEnum.kCenterPointIntent))
            End If
            If Not Contiene(ys, cp.Y) Then
                ys.Add(cp.Y)
                colY.Add(sh.CreateGeometryIntent(cv, PointIntentEnum.kCenterPointIntent))
            End If
            Dim r As Double = cv.Evaluator2D.RangeBox.MaxPoint.X - cp.X
            If Not Contiene(rs, r) Then
                rs.Add(r)
                Try
                    gd.AddDiameter(TG.CreatePoint2d(cp.X + r + 1.2, cp.Y + r + 1.2), sh.CreateGeometryIntent(cv))
                Catch ex As Exception
                    resumen.AppendLine("  diametro: " & ex.Message)
                End Try
            End If
        Next
        Dim ods As OrdinateDimensionSets = sh.DrawingDimensions.OrdinateDimensionSets
        ods.Add(colX, TG.CreatePoint2d(minX, maxY + 0.8), DimensionTypeEnum.kHorizontalDimensionType)
        If ys.Count > 0 Then ods.Add(colY, TG.CreatePoint2d(minX - 0.8, minY), DimensionTypeEnum.kVerticalDimensionType)
    Catch ex As Exception
        resumen.AppendLine("  agujeros: " & ex.Message)
    End Try
End Sub

Function Contiene(l As List(Of Double), x As Double) As Boolean
    For Each y As Double In l
        If Math.Abs(x - y) < 0.01 Then Return True
    Next
    Return False
End Function

' ===================== utilidades =====================
Function Nota(sh As Sheet, t As String) As GeneralNote
    Try
        Dim gn As GeneralNote = sh.DrawingNotes.GeneralNotes.AddFitted(TG.CreatePoint2d(2.5, 7.4), t)
        SetTag(gn, "NOTA", "SI")
        Return gn
    Catch ex As Exception
        resumen.AppendLine("  nota: " & ex.Message)
        Return Nothing
    End Try
End Function

Function ExportarPdf(dwg As DrawingDocument, ruta As String) As Boolean
    Try
        Dim pdf As TranslatorAddIn = ThisApplication.ApplicationAddIns.ItemById("{0AC6FD96-2F4D-42CE-8BE0-8AEA580399E4}")
        Dim ctx As TranslationContext = ThisApplication.TransientObjects.CreateTranslationContext()
        ctx.Type = IOMechanismEnum.kFileBrowseIOMechanism
        Dim op As NameValueMap = ThisApplication.TransientObjects.CreateNameValueMap()
        If pdf.HasSaveCopyAsOptions(dwg, ctx, op) Then
            op.Value("All_Color_AS_Black") = 1
            op.Value("Sheet_Range") = PrintRangeEnum.kPrintAllSheets
        End If
        ' si el PDF anterior esta abierto en un visor, se guarda con otro nombre
        Try
            If System.IO.File.Exists(ruta) Then System.IO.File.Delete(ruta)
        Catch
            ruta = System.IO.Path.Combine(System.IO.Path.GetDirectoryName(ruta), System.IO.Path.GetFileNameWithoutExtension(ruta) & "_" & DateTime.Now.ToString("HHmmss") & ".pdf")
            resumen.AppendLine("El PDF anterior esta abierto en otro programa: se guarda como " & System.IO.Path.GetFileName(ruta))
        End Try
        Dim dm As DataMedium = ThisApplication.TransientObjects.CreateDataMedium()
        dm.FileName = ruta
        pdf.SaveCopyAs(dwg, ctx, op, dm)
        resumen.AppendLine("PDF: " & ruta)
        Return True
    Catch ex As Exception
        resumen.AppendLine("PDF error: " & ex.Message)
        Return False
    End Try
End Function

' Planta (hijo directo del ensamble GENERAL) que es o contiene el documento editado
Function PlantaDe(gen As AssemblyDocument, d As Document) As AssemblyDocument
    For Each oc As ComponentOccurrence In gen.ComponentDefinition.Occurrences
        Dim od As AssemblyDocument = TryCast(oc.Definition.Document, AssemblyDocument)
        If od Is Nothing Then Continue For
        If od Is d Then Return od
        For Each rd As Document In od.AllReferencedDocuments
            If rd Is d Then Return od
        Next
    Next
    Return Nothing
End Function

Function BuscarPlantilla(asm As Document) As String
    Dim a As String = Arg("plantilla")
    If a <> "" AndAlso System.IO.File.Exists(a) Then Return a
    Dim nombres() As String = {"PLANTILLA COIMSER A3 - TEKLA.idw", "PLANTILLA COIMSER A3.idw"}
    Dim subs() As String = {"", "plantillas", "Plantillas", "inventor drawings", "iLogic"}
    For Each n As String In nombres
        Dim dir As String = System.IO.Path.GetDirectoryName(asm.FullFileName)
        For lvl As Integer = 0 To 6
            If dir Is Nothing Then Exit For
            For Each sd As String In subs
                Dim p As String = System.IO.Path.Combine(System.IO.Path.Combine(dir, sd), n)
                If System.IO.File.Exists(p) Then Return p
            Next
            dir = System.IO.Path.GetDirectoryName(dir)
        Next
    Next
    Return ""
End Function

Function CompararMarca(a As String, b As String) As Integer
    Return String.Compare(a, b, True)
End Function

' "EE" + "ANTAPACAY" -> "EE-ANTAPACAY"; "EE" + "ANT-EE" -> "ANT-EE" (no repite la planta)
' Carpeta de salida: fase -> <fase>\PLANOS ; conjunto / subconjunto -> <carpeta del conjunto>\PLANOS
' Cuantas veces esta el conjunto en la fase (suma de PERTENECE_A: "CP1 x2" -> 2); 1 si no hay dato
Function CantidadEnFase(asm As AssemblyDocument) As Integer
    Dim n As Integer = 0
    Try
        For Each parte As String In UProp(asm, "PERTENECE_A").Split(","c)
            Dim i As Integer = parte.LastIndexOf("x")
            Dim q As Integer
            If i >= 0 AndAlso Integer.TryParse(parte.Substring(i + 1).Trim(), q) Then n += q
        Next
    Catch
    End Try
    If n < 1 Then n = 1
    Return n
End Function

Function CarpetaSalida(asm As AssemblyDocument) As String
    Dim dir As String = System.IO.Path.GetDirectoryName(asm.FullFileName)
    Dim nom As String = System.IO.Path.GetFileNameWithoutExtension(asm.FullFileName)
    If UProp(asm, "TIPO_ENSAMBLE").ToUpper() <> "PLANTA" AndAlso UProp(asm, "PREFIJO") <> "" Then
        If System.IO.Path.GetFileName(dir).ToUpper() = nom.ToUpper() Then Return System.IO.Path.Combine(dir, "PLANOS")
        Return System.IO.Path.Combine(System.IO.Path.Combine(dir, nom), "PLANOS")
    End If
    Return System.IO.Path.Combine(dir, "PLANOS")
End Function

Function NomBase(planta As String, nombre As String) As String
    If nombre.ToUpper() = planta.ToUpper() OrElse nombre.ToUpper().EndsWith("-" & planta.ToUpper()) OrElse nombre.ToUpper().Contains("-" & planta.ToUpper() & "-") Then Return nombre
    Return planta & "-" & nombre
End Function

Function Arg(n As String) As String
    Try
        If RuleArguments.Exists(n) Then Return CStr(RuleArguments.Value(n))
    Catch
    End Try
    Return ""
End Function

Function UProp(d As Document, n As String) As String
    Try
        Return CStr(d.PropertySets.Item("Inventor User Defined Properties").Item(n).Value)
    Catch
        Return ""
    End Try
End Function

Function DProp(d As Document, n As String) As String
    Try
        Return CStr(d.PropertySets.Item("Design Tracking Properties").Item(n).Value)
    Catch
        Return ""
    End Try
End Function

Function Num(s As String) As Double
    Dim r As Double
    If Double.TryParse(s.Replace(",", "."), Globalization.NumberStyles.Any, Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture, r) Then Return r
    Return 0
End Function

Sub Aviso(t As String)
    resumen.AppendLine(t)
    If Not silencioso Then MessageBox.Show(t, "GENERAR_PLANOS")
End Sub


' Panel "Modelo" del navegador (el nombre visible cambia con el idioma de Inventor)
Function PanelModelo(dwg As DrawingDocument) As BrowserPane
    For Each bp As BrowserPane In dwg.BrowserPanes
        If bp.InternalName = "DlHierarchy" Then Return bp
    Next
    Return dwg.BrowserPanes.ActivePane
End Function

' ===================== referencias (NUEVA_REFERENCIA) =====================
Function EsRef(o As ComponentOccurrence) As Boolean
    Try
        If o.BOMStructure = BOMStructureEnum.kReferenceBOMStructure Then Return True
    Catch
    End Try
    Try
        If UProp(o.Definition.Document, "REFERENCIA").ToUpper() = "SI" Then Return True
    Catch
    End Try
    Return False
End Function

Function DentroDeRef(o As ComponentOccurrence) As Boolean
    Dim x As ComponentOccurrence = o
    Dim n As Integer = 0
    Do While x IsNot Nothing AndAlso n < 20
        If EsRef(x) Then Return True
        Try
            x = x.ParentOccurrence
        Catch
            x = Nothing
        End Try
        n += 1
    Loop
    Return False
End Function

' Oculta en la vista las referencias del ensamble d (cualquier nivel)
Sub OcultarRef(v As DrawingView, d As Object)
    Dim a As AssemblyDocument = TryCast(d, AssemblyDocument)
    If v Is Nothing OrElse a Is Nothing Then Exit Sub
    OcultarEn(v, a.ComponentDefinition.Occurrences)
End Sub

Sub OcultarEn(v As DrawingView, occs As Object)
    For Each o As ComponentOccurrence In occs
        Try
            If o.Suppressed Then Continue For
            If EsRef(o) Then
                v.SetVisibility(o, False)
            ElseIf o.DefinitionDocumentType = DocumentTypeEnum.kAssemblyDocumentObject Then
                OcultarEn(v, o.SubOccurrences)
            End If
        Catch
        End Try
    Next
End Sub

' Caja del modelo SIN referencias ni piezas sin solidos (skeletons): para la escala
Function Caja(d As Document) As Box
    Dim rb As Box = d.ComponentDefinition.RangeBox
    If d.DocumentType <> DocumentTypeEnum.kAssemblyDocumentObject Then Return rb
    Dim b As Box = Nothing
    CajaEn(CType(d, AssemblyDocument).ComponentDefinition.Occurrences, b)
    If b Is Nothing Then Return rb
    Return b
End Function

Sub CajaEn(occs As Object, ByRef b As Box)
    For Each o As ComponentOccurrence In occs
        Try
            If o.Suppressed OrElse EsRef(o) Then Continue For
            If o.DefinitionDocumentType = DocumentTypeEnum.kAssemblyDocumentObject Then
                CajaEn(o.SubOccurrences, b)
                Continue For
            End If
            Dim pd As PartDocument = TryCast(o.Definition.Document, PartDocument)
            If pd IsNot Nothing AndAlso pd.ComponentDefinition.SurfaceBodies.Count = 0 Then Continue For
            Dim r As Box = o.RangeBox
            If b Is Nothing Then
                b = r.Copy()
            Else
                b.Extend(r.MinPoint)
                b.Extend(r.MaxPoint)
            End If
        Catch
        End Try
    Next
End Sub

' ===================== desarrollo de chapa (v2.6) =====================
' Pieza de chapa con desarrollo (lo crea si falta). desarrollo=NO lo desactiva.
Function ConDesarrollo(d As Document) As Boolean
    If Arg("desarrollo").ToUpper() = "NO" Then Return False
    If d Is Nothing OrElse d.DocumentType <> DocumentTypeEnum.kPartDocumentObject Then Return False
    If d.SubType <> "{9C464203-9BAE-11D3-8BAD-0060B0CE6BB4}" Then Return False
    Try
        Dim sm As SheetMetalComponentDefinition = CType(CType(d, PartDocument).ComponentDefinition, SheetMetalComponentDefinition)
        If sm.SurfaceBodies.Count = 0 Then Return False
        Dim tenia As Boolean = sm.HasFlatPattern AndAlso Math.Min(sm.FlatPattern.Length, sm.FlatPattern.Width) > 1.5 * sm.Thickness.Value
        If Not tenia Then
            DesarrolloBien(sm)
            Try
                If (System.IO.File.GetAttributes(d.FullFileName) And System.IO.FileAttributes.ReadOnly) <> System.IO.FileAttributes.ReadOnly Then d.Save2(False)
            Catch
            End Try
        End If
        Return sm.HasFlatPattern
    Catch
        Return False
    End Try
End Function

Function VistaDesarrollo(sh As Sheet) As DrawingView
    For Each dv As DrawingView In sh.DrawingViews
        Try
            If GetTag(dv, "DESARROLLO") = "SI" OrElse dv.IsFlatPatternView Then Return dv
        Catch
        End Try
    Next
    Return Nothing
End Function

' Vista del desarrollo en la zona dada: escala normalizada, cotas totales, notas de plegado y titulo
Sub Desarrollo(sh As Sheet, d As Document, x0 As Double, y0 As Double, x1 As Double, y1 As Double)
    Try
        Dim sm As SheetMetalComponentDefinition = CType(CType(d, PartDocument).ComponentDefinition, SheetMetalComponentDefinition)
        Dim fp As FlatPattern = sm.FlatPattern
        Dim L As Double = fp.Length
        Dim W As Double = fp.Width
        Dim dens() As Double = {1, 2, 2.5, 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 30, 40, 50, 75, 100, 150, 200, 250}
        Dim den As Double = 250
        For Each dd As Double In dens
            If Math.Max(L, W) / dd <= (x1 - x0 - 4) AndAlso Math.Min(L, W) / dd <= (y1 - y0 - 5) AndAlso L / dd <= (x1 - x0 - 4) Then
                den = dd
                Exit For
            End If
        Next
        Dim opts As NameValueMap = ThisApplication.TransientObjects.CreateNameValueMap()
        opts.Add("SheetMetalFoldedModel", False)
        Try : sh.Activate() : Catch : End Try
        Dim cx As Double = (x0 + x1) / 2
        Dim cy As Double = (y0 + y1) / 2 - 0.5
        Dim vf As DrawingView = sh.DrawingViews.AddBaseView(d, TG.CreatePoint2d(cx, cy), 1 / den, ViewOrientationTypeEnum.kDefaultViewOrientation, DrawingViewStyleEnum.kHiddenLineRemovedDrawingViewStyle, "", Nothing, opts)
        ' si quedo mas alto que ancho y no entra, se gira 90
        If vf.Height > (y1 - y0 - 4) AndAlso vf.Width < vf.Height Then
            Try : vf.RotateByAngle(Math.PI / 2) : Catch : End Try
        End If
        SetTag(vf, "DESARROLLO", "SI")
        AcotarTotal(sh, vf, True, True)
        ' notas de plegado (sentido y angulo)
        Dim nPl As Integer = 0
        For Each cv As DrawingCurve In vf.DrawingCurves
            Try
                If cv.EdgeType = DrawingEdgeTypeEnum.kBendUpEdge OrElse cv.EdgeType = DrawingEdgeTypeEnum.kBendDownEdge Then
                    sh.DrawingNotes.BendNotes.Add(cv)
                    nPl += 1
                End If
            Catch
            End Try
        Next
        Dim t As String = "DESARROLLO  ESC 1:" & den & "   " & (L * 10).ToString("0") & " x " & (W * 10).ToString("0") & " mm" & If(nPl > 0, "   (" & nPl & " plegados)", "")
        Dim gn As GeneralNote = sh.DrawingNotes.GeneralNotes.AddFitted(TG.CreatePoint2d(vf.Left, vf.Top + 2.4), t)
        SetTag(gn, "NOTA", "DESARROLLO")
        resumen.AppendLine("    desarrollo " & (L * 10).ToString("0") & " x " & (W * 10).ToString("0") & " mm, esc 1:" & den)
    Catch ex As Exception
        resumen.AppendLine("  desarrollo: " & ex.Message)
    End Try
End Sub

' Ruta completa de un archivo de reglas (o dato) en las carpetas de reglas externas de iLogic,
' incluidas sus subcarpetas (1_OBRA, 2_MODELADO...).
Function RutaRegla(archivo As String) As String
    If Not archivo.Contains(".") Then archivo &= ".iLogicVb"
    Try
        For Each raiz As String In iLogicVb.Automation.FileOptions.ExternalRuleDirectories
            If Not System.IO.Directory.Exists(raiz) Then Continue For
            For Each f As String In System.IO.Directory.GetFiles(raiz, archivo, System.IO.SearchOption.AllDirectories)
                If f.ToLower().Contains("\_to_delete\") OrElse f.ToLower().Contains("\oldversions\") Then Continue For
                Return f
            Next
        Next
    Catch
    End Try
    Return ""
End Function

' Desarrollo de chapa con la cara A en la cara plana MAYOR. Una chapa hecha desde un solido
' (STEP, derivada) a veces se desarrolla "de canto" (ancho = espesor): aqui se rehace.
' Devuelve True si hay desarrollo valido.
Function DesarrolloBien(sm As SheetMetalComponentDefinition) As Boolean
    Try
        Dim t As Double = sm.Thickness.Value
        If sm.HasFlatPattern Then
            Dim w As Double = Math.Min(sm.FlatPattern.Length, sm.FlatPattern.Width)
            If w > 1.5 * t Then Return True
            sm.FlatPattern.Delete()
        End If
        Dim big As Face = Nothing
        Dim a As Double = 0
        For Each f As Face In sm.SurfaceBodies.Item(1).Faces
            If f.SurfaceType = SurfaceTypeEnum.kPlaneSurface AndAlso f.Evaluator.Area > a Then
                a = f.Evaluator.Area
                big = f
            End If
        Next
        If big IsNot Nothing Then
            For i As Integer = sm.ASideDefinitions.Count To 1 Step -1
                Try : sm.ASideDefinitions.Item(i).Delete() : Catch : End Try
            Next
            Try : sm.ASideDefinitions.Add(big) : Catch : End Try
        End If
        sm.Unfold()
        Try : sm.FlatPattern.ExitEdit() : Catch : End Try
        Return sm.HasFlatPattern
    Catch
        Return False
    End Try
End Function

' ===================== ejes propios del modelo (v2.9) =====================
' Ejes (3 vectores unitarios), extension en cada eje y centro del modelo:
'  - el marco sale de la PIEZA MAS GRANDE: normal de su cara plana mayor + su arista recta mas
'    larga sobre esa cara (una viga, una plancha, un perfil girado dan su propia orientacion);
'  - si ese marco esta a menos de 0.5 grados de los ejes del ensamble, se usan X, Y, Z.
Sub Marco(d As Document, ByRef ejes() As UnitVector, ByRef ext() As Double, ByRef c As Point)
    ejes = New UnitVector() {TG.CreateUnitVector(1, 0, 0), TG.CreateUnitVector(0, 1, 0), TG.CreateUnitVector(0, 0, 1)}
    Dim pts As New List(Of Point)
    Dim cuerpoGuia As SurfaceBody = Nothing
    Dim volMax As Double = 0
    Try
        If d.DocumentType = DocumentTypeEnum.kPartDocumentObject Then
            For Each b As SurfaceBody In CType(d, PartDocument).ComponentDefinition.SurfaceBodies
                AgregarPuntos(b, pts)
                Dim vb As Double = b.Volume(0.01)
                If vb > volMax Then volMax = vb : cuerpoGuia = b
            Next
        Else
            MarcoEn(CType(d, AssemblyDocument).ComponentDefinition.Occurrences, pts, cuerpoGuia, volMax)
        End If
    Catch
    End Try
    Dim girado As UnitVector() = EjesDeCuerpo(cuerpoGuia)
    If girado IsNot Nothing Then
        Dim recto As Boolean = True
        For Each v As UnitVector In girado
            If Math.Max(Math.Abs(v.X), Math.Max(Math.Abs(v.Y), Math.Abs(v.Z))) < Math.Cos(0.5 * Math.PI / 180) Then recto = False
        Next
        If Not recto Then ejes = girado
    End If
    If girado Is Nothing OrElse ejes(0).X > 0.99999 Then
        Try
            If d.DocumentType = DocumentTypeEnum.kPartDocumentObject Then
                For Each b As SurfaceBody In CType(d, PartDocument).ComponentDefinition.SurfaceBodies
                    pts.Add(b.RangeBox.MinPoint) : pts.Add(b.RangeBox.MaxPoint)
                Next
            Else
                Dim rb0 As Box = Caja(d)
                pts.Add(rb0.MinPoint) : pts.Add(rb0.MaxPoint)
            End If
        Catch
        End Try
    End If
    ext = New Double() {0, 0, 0}
    If pts.Count = 0 Then
        Dim rb As Box = Caja(d)
        ext = New Double() {rb.MaxPoint.X - rb.MinPoint.X, rb.MaxPoint.Y - rb.MinPoint.Y, rb.MaxPoint.Z - rb.MinPoint.Z}
        c = TG.CreatePoint((rb.MinPoint.X + rb.MaxPoint.X) / 2, (rb.MinPoint.Y + rb.MaxPoint.Y) / 2, (rb.MinPoint.Z + rb.MaxPoint.Z) / 2)
        Exit Sub
    End If
    Dim mn() As Double = {1.0E+30, 1.0E+30, 1.0E+30}
    Dim mx() As Double = {-1.0E+30, -1.0E+30, -1.0E+30}
    For Each q As Point In pts
        For i As Integer = 0 To 2
            Dim x As Double = q.X * ejes(i).X + q.Y * ejes(i).Y + q.Z * ejes(i).Z
            If x < mn(i) Then mn(i) = x
            If x > mx(i) Then mx(i) = x
        Next
    Next
    Dim cx As Double = 0, cy As Double = 0, cz As Double = 0
    For i As Integer = 0 To 2
        ext(i) = mx(i) - mn(i)
        Dim m As Double = (mx(i) + mn(i)) / 2
        cx += m * ejes(i).X : cy += m * ejes(i).Y : cz += m * ejes(i).Z
    Next
    c = TG.CreatePoint(cx, cy, cz)
End Sub

Sub MarcoEn(occs As Object, pts As List(Of Point), ByRef guia As SurfaceBody, ByRef volMax As Double)
    For Each o As ComponentOccurrence In occs
        Try
            If o.Suppressed OrElse EsRef(o) OrElse Not o.Visible Then Continue For
            If o.DefinitionDocumentType = DocumentTypeEnum.kAssemblyDocumentObject Then
                MarcoEn(o.SubOccurrences, pts, guia, volMax)
                Continue For
            End If
            For Each b As SurfaceBody In o.SurfaceBodies
                AgregarPuntos(b, pts)
                Dim vb As Double = b.Volume(0.01)
                If vb > volMax Then volMax = vb : guia = b
            Next
        Catch
        End Try
    Next
End Sub

Sub AgregarPuntos(b As SurfaceBody, pts As List(Of Point))
    Try
        For Each v As Vertex In b.Vertices
            pts.Add(v.Point)
        Next
        If b.Vertices.Count = 0 Then
            pts.Add(b.RangeBox.MinPoint)
            pts.Add(b.RangeBox.MaxPoint)
        End If
    Catch
    End Try
End Sub

' Ejes de un cuerpo: normal de la cara plana mayor, arista recta mas larga de esa cara, y su producto
Function EjesDeCuerpo(b As SurfaceBody) As UnitVector()
    If b Is Nothing Then Return Nothing
    Try
        Dim f1 As Face = Nothing
        Dim a1 As Double = 0
        For Each f As Face In b.Faces
            If f.SurfaceType = SurfaceTypeEnum.kPlaneSurface AndAlso f.Evaluator.Area > a1 Then
                a1 = f.Evaluator.Area
                f1 = f
            End If
        Next
        If f1 Is Nothing Then Return Nothing
        ' v2.16: en conos / cilindros la cara plana mayor es el canto del corte: no sirve de guia
        Dim aTot As Double = 0
        For Each f As Face In b.Faces
            aTot += f.Evaluator.Area
        Next
        If a1 < 0.15 * aTot Then Return Nothing
        Dim n As UnitVector = CType(f1.Geometry, Plane).Normal
        Dim u As UnitVector = Nothing
        Dim lu As Double = 0
        For Each ed As Edge In f1.Edges
            If ed.GeometryType <> CurveTypeEnum.kLineSegmentCurve Then Continue For
            Dim ps As Point = ed.StartVertex.Point, pe As Point = ed.StopVertex.Point
            Dim dd As Double = ps.DistanceTo(pe)
            If dd > lu Then
                lu = dd
                u = TG.CreateUnitVector(pe.X - ps.X, pe.Y - ps.Y, pe.Z - ps.Z)
            End If
        Next
        If u Is Nothing Then Return Nothing
        Dim v As UnitVector = n.CrossProduct(u)
        Return New UnitVector() {u, v, n}
    Catch
        Return Nothing
    End Try
End Function

' La vista base no mira segun los ejes propios del modelo (solo si el modelo esta girado)
Function VistaTorcida(v As DrawingView, d As Document) As Boolean
    Try
        Dim ej() As UnitVector = Nothing, ex() As Double = Nothing, cc As Point = Nothing
        Marco(d, ej, ex, cc)
        Dim recto As Boolean = True
        For Each u As UnitVector In ej
            If Math.Max(Math.Abs(u.X), Math.Max(Math.Abs(u.Y), Math.Abs(u.Z))) < 0.9999 Then recto = False
        Next
        If recto Then Return False
        Dim iSm As Integer = 0
        For i As Integer = 1 To 2
            If ex(i) < ex(iSm) Then iSm = i
        Next
        Dim cam As Camera = v.Camera
        Dim dx As Double = cam.Eye.X - cam.Target.X, dy As Double = cam.Eye.Y - cam.Target.Y, dz As Double = cam.Eye.Z - cam.Target.Z
        Dim L As Double = Math.Sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy + dz * dz)
        If L = 0 Then Return False
        Dim dotv As Double = Math.Abs((dx * ej(iSm).X + dy * ej(iSm).Y + dz * ej(iSm).Z) / L)
        Return dotv < 0.999
    Catch
        Return False
    End Try
End Function

' ESTADO del conjunto: MODELADO < NUMERADO < PLANOS < EMITIDO < EN CORTE < FABRICADO < MONTADO. Solo sube (nunca baja);
' FABRICADO y MONTADO los pones tu. Si el conjunto ya esta mas adelante no se toca.
Sub SubirEstado(d As Document, nuevo As String)
    Try
        If d Is Nothing Then Exit Sub
        Dim pref As String = ""
        Try : pref = CStr(d.PropertySets.Item("Inventor User Defined Properties").Item("PREFIJO").Value).Trim() : Catch : End Try
        If pref = "" Then Exit Sub
        Dim orden() As String = {"MODELADO", "NUMERADO", "PLANOS", "EMITIDO", "EN CORTE", "FABRICADO", "MONTADO"}
        Dim actual As String = ""
        Try : actual = CStr(d.PropertySets.Item("Inventor User Defined Properties").Item("ESTADO").Value).Trim().ToUpper() : Catch : End Try
        If Array.IndexOf(orden, actual) >= Array.IndexOf(orden, nuevo) Then Exit Sub
        Dim ps As PropertySet = d.PropertySets.Item("Inventor User Defined Properties")
        Try
            ps.Item("ESTADO").Value = nuevo
        Catch
            ps.Add(nuevo, "ESTADO")
        End Try
    Catch
    End Try
End Sub

' ===================== v2.17 plano jerarquico =====================
Private jerarquico As Boolean = True
Private hTras As New List(Of String)

' Conjuntos y subconjuntos (cualquier nivel) que llevan plano propio: ensambles numerados con PREFIJO
Function Descendientes(asm As AssemblyDocument) As List(Of AssemblyDocument)
    Dim l As New List(Of AssemblyDocument)
    For Each x As Document In asm.AllReferencedDocuments
        Try
            Dim a As AssemblyDocument = TryCast(x, AssemblyDocument)
            If a Is Nothing OrElse l.Contains(a) Then Continue For
            If ConPlanoPropio(a) Then l.Add(a)
        Catch
        End Try
    Next
    l.Sort(Function(p As AssemblyDocument, q As AssemblyDocument) String.Compare(p.FullFileName, q.FullFileName, True))
    Return l
End Function

Function ConPlanoPropio(d As Document) As Boolean
    If d.DocumentType <> DocumentTypeEnum.kAssemblyDocumentObject Then Return False
    If UProp(d, "PREFIJO") = "" OrElse UProp(d, "MARCA") = "" Then Return False
    If UProp(d, "EQUIPO").ToUpper() = "SI" OrElse UProp(d, "REFERENCIA").ToUpper() = "SI" Then Return False
    If UProp(d, "TIPO_ENSAMBLE").ToUpper() = "PLANTA" OrElse UProp(d, "TIPO_ENSAMBLE").ToUpper() = "GENERAL" Then Return False
    Return True
End Function

' Marcas que existen en todo el arbol del ensamble (para saber si una hoja que sale de este plano
' paso al plano de su conjunto o de verdad quedo obsoleta)
Function MarcasDelArbol(asm As AssemblyDocument) As HashSet(Of String)
    Dim h As New HashSet(Of String)(StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase)
    For Each x As Document In asm.AllReferencedDocuments
        Try
            Dim mk As String = UProp(x, "MARCA")
            If mk <> "" Then h.Add(mk)
        Catch
        End Try
    Next
    Return h
End Function

Sub Reiniciar()
    planta = "" : proy = ""
    errores.Clear() : resumen = New System.Text.StringBuilder()
    conjOrden.Clear() : conjDoc.Clear() : cantConj.Clear() : partDoc.Clear() : cantParte.Clear() : partesDe.Clear()
    hNuevas.Clear() : hActual.Clear() : hObsol.Clear() : hTras.Clear()
    notasFab = Nothing
    modoGA = False
End Sub

' Nombre de la primera hoja: DISPOSICION GENERAL <planta> en la fase, DISPOSICION GENERAL <marca> en un conjunto
Function NombreGA(asm As AssemblyDocument) As String
    Dim mk As String = UProp(asm, "MARCA")
    If UProp(asm, "TIPO_ENSAMBLE").ToUpper() <> "PLANTA" AndAlso mk <> "" Then Return "DISPOSICION GENERAL " & mk
    Return "DISPOSICION GENERAL " & planta
End Function
